<title>POLAND: Krosno Q2 net falls to PLN 2.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Krosno Q2 net falls to PLN 2.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krosno preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     4.55   vs    5.25</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 3.87   vs    5.15</p>
<p>    net profit			     2.52   vs    3.39</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Krosnienskie Huty Szkla Krosno SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     47.20   vs   46.17</p>
<p>    costs of sales			33.06   vs   30.77</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.01   vs    0.01 loss</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.09   vs    1.69</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.26   vs    0.07</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.25   vs    3.41</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.93   vs    3.50</p>
<p>    investment			     1.36   vs    1.00</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     7.19   vs   10.23</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 6.88   vs    9.59</p>
<p>    net profit			     4.28   vs    6.26</p>
<p>    net sales			     92.67   vs   90.97</p>
<p>    costs of sales			65.64   vs   60.98</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 3.30   vs    0.01 loss</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.23   vs    3.21</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.37   vs    0.12</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.57   vs    4.93</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.90   vs    5.55</p>
<p>    investment			     2.06   vs    1.58</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
